tDialogue/WQ/Fontaine_74185/Q7418501","priority":5,"questId":74185,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":741850101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1794294642,"text":"Este, we're back!","nextNodeIds":[741850102]},{"nodeId":741850102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":942451730,"text":"Oh, if it isn't... Wait, no. Who are you?","nextNodeIds":[741850103]},{"nodeId":741850103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3513374050,"text":"#Huh? You can't have forgotten us already! We're {NICKNAME} and Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[741850104]},{"nodeId":741850104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":2832333994,"text":"#{NICKNAME} and Paimon... I have indeed heard tell of these names, but I could've sworn I heard them in a dream!","nextNodeIds":[741850105]},{"nodeId":741850105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":660201362,"text":"Uh... But you were definitely awake then, Este! Also, while we were below, didn't we even see...","nextNodeIds":[741850106]},{"nodeId":741850106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":346869178,"text":"*sigh* I dreamed that everyone in town was petrified, turned into statues of stone, leaving me utterly helpless and alone.","nextNodeIds":[741850107]},{"nodeId":741850107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":4095797922,"text":"Until finally, two brave heroes came and shouldered the burden of rescuing everyone... Could it be, that it was no dream at all?","nextNodeIds":[741850108,741850109]},{"nodeId":741850108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3322474778,"text":"Maybe, maybe not.","nextNodeIds":[741850110]},{"nodeId":741850110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3529571490,"text":"Yeah. After all, everyone's back to normal now, aren't they?","nextNodeIds":[741850111]},{"nodeId":741850111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":353434714,"text":"But it seems as though everyone had some very strange dreams indeed. Just what happened? Could we all have been hypnotized en masse?","nextNodeIds":[741850112]},{"nodeId":741850112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1090053690,"text":"It would take us ages to explain it all properly... Just forget about the hypnosis thing for now!","nextNodeIds":[741850113]},{"nodeId":741850113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":635238162,"text":"Oh? Speaking of hypnosis, you two even brought over a cat! It looks quite intelligent.","nextNodeIds":[741850114,741850116]},{"nodeId":741850114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":801473746,"text":"He's even smarter than he looks.","nextNodeIds":[741850115]},{"nodeId":741850115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1508842874,"text":"And moreover, he's our companion! But unfortunately, we can't take him with us on our journey...","nextNodeIds":[741850118]},{"nodeId":741850118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":2405294978,"text":"Well now, isn't that a coincidence? Our club just happens to have an open bed for cats available. It's been unoccupied ever since that hypnosis researcher went a-traveling and took his cat with him.","nextNodeIds":[741850119]},{"nodeId":741850119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":4039893338,"text":"If you two don't mind, leave him here with us. We'll take care of him.","nextNodeIds":[741850120]},{"nodeId":741850120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":1934260266,"text":"Though I can't quite put my finger on it, I feel like we're bound up together, almost as if by fate. I'll help you take very good care of him indeed.","nextNodeIds":[741850121]},{"nodeId":741850121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"Este","textMapHash":1247706946,"text":"The cattery is on the other side of the building. Just walk over and you'll see it.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":741850116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3131261594,"text":"He's our companion.","nextNodeIds":[741850117]},{"nodeId":741850117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2096246954,"text":"That's true, but we still can't take him with us on our journey...","nextNodeIds":[741850118]},{"nodeId":741850109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3234459922,"text":"That's not important.","nextNodeIds":[741850110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7418501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7418502,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Bring Osse to the cattery","stepDescTextMapHash":747051948,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7418502"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGL