 bit weird. Cassiodor should've already left here, right? So who is Osse now?","nextNodeIds":[741850304]},{"nodeId":741850304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3370919074,"text":"Is it the original cat that hadn't been indwelt by Cassiodor, or is it the Monsieur Os that shared all those adventures with us...? Ugh, Paimon's brain is cramping up.","nextNodeIds":[741850305,741850307]},{"nodeId":741850305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3676332730,"text":"Paimon, you're really not suited to thinking about stuff like this.","nextNodeIds":[741850306]},{"nodeId":741850306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2605967738,"text":"Paimon doesn't get it at all...","nextNodeIds":[741850309]},{"nodeId":741850309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1382236938,"text":"Anyway, we've found a new home for Osse now, too! If we've got time, maybe we can come play with him!","nextNodeIds":[741850310]},{"nodeId":741850310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21431,"speakerName":"Osse","textMapHash":2683032562,"text":"Meow meow!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":741850307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":656805058,"text":"\"Osse\" is \"Osse.\"","nextNodeIds":[741850308]},{"nodeId":741850308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2261740714,"text":"Though Paimon still doesn't get it, it does make a certain kind of sense...","nextNodeIds":[741850309]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7418503,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7419501","4"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133405063"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCE